    "description": "**Related:** WAGR-20, WAGR-370\n\n**Summary:** Joyce wants historical Sign-Ups in Salesforce. The agreed scope mostly excludes them. The plan (WAGR-20) cannot be final until the scope is.\n\n**Decide:** historical Sign-Ups, yes or no; historical redeposit and payout data; US Deals and Deal Rep Assignments; the 26 Deals with no Source; whether the legacy Google Sheets keep getting data during the switch-over.\n\n**Done when:** the scope is agreed in writing, and WAGR-20 is updated to match.\n\n**Sources (traceable):**\n\n* Weekly sync, 2026-08-11 (Joyce: historical Sign-Ups) — https://fathom.video/calls/778966539\n* Internal sync, 2026-08-20 (US Deals/DRAs import) — Kobiwan/meetings/2026-08-20_kobi-taryn-daily-sync/summary.md\n* Joyce, Slack 2026-08-11 (Airtable reps/DRAs migration) — https://jumpr-solutions.slack.com/archives/C0BBC05C2HG/p1786454285452979\n\n---\n\n_Captured 2026-09-25 by Kobi from the WagerTech calls, Slack, Jira and sandbox review (Jul–Sep 2026). Design backlog item: requirements only, not a solution._",
